Output ../assets/demo/tour.gif
Output ../assets/demo/tour.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear && beepertui" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Down@400ms 3
Sleep 600ms
Up@400ms 3
Sleep 500ms
# open Design Team: day rules, the "new" line, sender colours, link card, image
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Up@350ms 4
Sleep 1.2s
Down@350ms 4
Sleep 1s
# inbox tabs
Type "]"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "["
Sleep 800ms
Type "?"
Sleep 3.5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
